B. Créer un holder

Ajoute cette méthode :

private ActiveMqSenderHolder createSenderHolder(
        ActiveMQConfiguration configuration) {
    String key = activeMqKey(configuration);
    ConnectionFactory createdFactory =
            jmsTemplateService.amqConnectionFactory(configuration);
    if (!(createdFactory
            instanceof AtomikosConnectionFactoryBean atomikosFactory)) {
        throw new IllegalStateException(
                "AtomikosConnectionFactoryBean attendue pour " + key
        );
    }
    try {
        JmsTemplate jmsTemplate =
                jmsTemplateService.build(atomikosFactory);
        if (jmsTemplate == null) {
            throw new IllegalStateException(
                    "Impossible de créer le JmsTemplate pour " + key
            );
        }
        return new ActiveMqSenderHolder(
                atomikosFactory,
                jmsTemplate
        );
    } catch (RuntimeException exception) {
        closeQuietly(key, atomikosFactory);
        throw exception;
    }
}

Cette méthode crée :

une factory Atomikos
+
son pool interne
+
un JmsTemplate

